{"id":"42322b2e4562a7f4","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-minimality-tree.md","title":"全部黑白函数树需求给出非零极小度","display":"lem-minimality-tree — 全部黑白函数树需求给出非零极小度","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-minimality-tree","aliases":["20-lem-minimality-tree"],"display":"lem-minimality-tree — 全部黑白函数树需求给出非零极小度","chapter":"12","section":"12.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemmas 12.2.1–12.2.3 的合并","source_printed_pages":[199,200],"source_pdf_pages":[229,230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal]]","[[20-lem-black-tree]]","[[20-lem-white-tree]]","[[20-lem-posner-epstein]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-minimality-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-minimality-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-minimality-tree — 全部黑白函数树需求给出非零极小度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemmas 12.2.1–12.2.3 的合并"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ecc018639c40052\" href=\"?note=8ecc018639c40052\" title=\"20-lem-black-tree\">20-lem-black-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c89da0dadf4f3bf5\" href=\"?note=c89da0dadf4f3bf5\" title=\"20-lem-white-tree\">20-lem-white-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af068cd3cee16486\" href=\"?note=af068cd3cee16486\" title=\"20-lem-posner-epstein\">20-lem-posner-epstein</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，存在全可计算函数树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_e\">\\(T_e\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{On}(A,T_e)\">\\(\\operatorname{On}(A,T_e)\\)</span> 且它为 e-黑或 e-白。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ecc018639c40052\" href=\"?note=8ecc018639c40052\" title=\"20-lem-black-tree\">20-lem-black-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c89da0dadf4f3bf5\" href=\"?note=c89da0dadf4f3bf5\" title=\"20-lem-white-tree\">20-lem-white-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"af068cd3cee16486\" href=\"?note=af068cd3cee16486\" title=\"20-lem-posner-epstein\">20-lem-posner-epstein</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}minimality-tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\deg_T(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}minimality-tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\deg_T(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Posner–Epstein 引理先保证非零，无需预先假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 非可计算。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_T A\">\\(B\\le_T A\\)</span> 由某个全二值泛函得到；黑树引理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可计算，白树引理使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T B\">\\(A\\le_T B\\)</span>。故没有非零严格下度。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 12.2.1–12.2.3 的合并；印刷页 199, 200；PDF 第 229, 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-black-tree","status":"resolved","id":"8ecc018639c40052","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-white-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c89da0dadf4f3bf5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-white-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-posner-epstein","status":"resolved","id":"af068cd3cee16486","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-posner-epstein]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-black-tree","status":"resolved","id":"8ecc018639c40052","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-white-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c89da0dadf4f3bf5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-posner-epstein","status":"resolved","id":"af068cd3cee16486","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"T_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{On}(A,T_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}minimality-tree}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\deg_T(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_T A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_T B","display":false}],"bytes":1379,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e72efb02984d69c","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]；see [[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]。"},{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["b8c49b6cb74c57b6","8ecc018639c40052","c89da0dadf4f3bf5","af068cd3cee16486"]}